# Level 6 (planet 6): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots (or not) and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. Hourglass turrets 1A and 19, the domes 11 and 1E, the magnets 1F and
# 20, and the drone generators 4B and 4C, with their shots, missiles, flames, drones and exhaust.
level 6
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
# Hourglass turrets 1A (two, one above the other): target (2208, 1940), the target lies below of the pod, which is set at (2208, 1840), camera (2080, 1696)
